{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Is the hand of YHWH shortened?</b> From finding a means by which they will loathe every desirable food, as it says: עַד אֲשֶׁר יֵצֵא מֵאַפְּכֶם (Numbers 11:20)." "<b>Now you shall see whether My word comes to you.</b> You shall see that this will come to pass — that they will eat of the flesh as they persist in their free choice of pursuing pleasure, until it comes out of their nostrils and they loathe it — all without My removing their free choice at all. For they can still return in repentance, from love and from fear, if they so wish, as it says: יָדַעְתִּי כִּי כֹל תּוּכָל וְלֹא יִבָּצֵר מִמְּךָ מְזִמָּה (Job 42:2)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:26.626240595Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}